WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.320
Rex had a xylophone at the zoo.

2
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.120
But the zebra ate Rex's xylophone.

3
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.000
Rex began to cry.

4
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:24.280
"Don't cry, Rex. Open the zebra's zipper."

5
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.680
Zip! Out came the xylophone.

